  "discordPostHtml": "<p>This mod overhauls the Player Faction using a modular, \"Choose-it-yourself\" structure.</p><p>Player Faction module - Revamps the player faction, giving custom dialogue to your faction, the diktat soundtrack for your faction (without Nexerelin), among other interesting things to make your faction seem less like a rag tag team group of people and more of a military force. Includes your faction in the intel screen with a 13th Battlegroup backstory.<br>UI Module - Changes the UI to a maroon color to match the 13th Battlegroup ships,<br>XIII Vanilla Ships - Extra Vanilla ships recolored to 13th Battlegroup maroon,<br>XIII Ships - The same as above, but also includes ballistic weapons stylized for the 13th battlegroup maroon, designed with expanded magazines in mind,<br>Omega BP - Allows collection of Omega vessels and weapons.</p><p>Starsector Forum Link:<br><a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=25040.0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=25040.0</a></p>",
